spot.map = new Texture();
... equals → true; spot.map.needsUpdate = true; → false
```
For the spot light with map data: {map: light.map.version, cacheVersion: 0}. After needsUpdate version 1 → data.map 1 vs 0 → false. Good.

15. scene environment: 
```js
